    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UTOPIA OF WOMEN\u2014the god, rulers, soldiers, even villains: all female.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo available in 4 languages! (\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4/English/\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587/\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e)</strong>\u2739The full English release has been officially localized by a professional translator.\u2739</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/b8f3d332c9ac91d10e6e0a6350c6dc0d.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=941 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All men have been wiped from the Earth. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It marks the dawn of a new world.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Only women remain in this post-apocalyptic world, where a vast and intriguing epic unfolds.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/64b485328ba1f52dc470be826473408c.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/64b485328ba1f52dc470be826473408c.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Under the blessing of La, the one true god, men vanished from this world 1,500 years ago.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this flawless peace, 'Eclipse,' a special forces unit composed of those with supernatural powers, has upheld law and order in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6ac6690801b232d45f80d9444d5046ba.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6ac6690801b232d45f80d9444d5046ba.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, with the rise of the new cult 'Apep,' hidden fractures begin to surface.<br>Haesu, a member of Eclipse, is caught in the whirlwind of a great destiny,<br>and behind the peace she has always believed in lies a forgotten truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At last, the Wheel of Fortune starts to turn.<br>What choice will Haesu make?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/b69b20287761226e1e4321a2086d739c.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/b69b20287761226e1e4321a2086d739c.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Everything rests in your hands.<br>Uncover the secrets of the Eclipse world with Haesu and face the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Visual Novel: Multi-Ending System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/45a1b582dc45d73592c5d35f9d2f448c.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/45a1b582dc45d73592c5d35f9d2f448c.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/77facc9d64a24b6c0fa40b051c827ada.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/77facc9d64a24b6c0fa40b051c827ada.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features branching points based on the player's choices, allowing them to experience various events and endings while progressing through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the direction of the story, and as a result, the protagonist will face different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Attack Feature: Choice or Fate?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6f48aafd833a0abf8b10c2e64251953e.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6f48aafd833a0abf8b10c2e64251953e.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In critical moments, a Time Attack bar will appear\u2014choose fast or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your insight as an Eclipse agent\u2014or fate? Your call.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Visual Concept: Manga</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/ba22bc7e98f4065fb109dbe1361a89d3.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/ba22bc7e98f4065fb109dbe1361a89d3.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/1f076cf33502660691ead71e366d115b.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/1f076cf33502660691ead71e366d115b.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main event scenes of the game are presented in a manga style, allowing players to experience the fun and nostalgia of flipping through a comic book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/3d0b555d593127532ecfbfa7e852a884.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 124 stunning illustrations and vibrant, manga-style expressions maximize immersion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worldview</strong>:\u00a0<strong>#EgyptianMythology #SupernaturalPowers #Military #PostApocalypse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Eclipse is designed with ancient Egyptian mythology as its motif. Immerse yourself in the fascinating epic where supernatural abilities and the military merge in a beautiful post-apocalyptic setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6e82601a0343e47cdca049250637248e.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6e82601a0343e47cdca049250637248e.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truly, seriously\u2014just women, beside women, beside more women. That\u2019s the whole game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/486f3f36e26c4c52567a6fdeec9e8483.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Haesu (The protagonist of <i>Eclipse</i>)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMhm, alright. Let\u2019s turn this place upside down.\u201d</i><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Member of <i>Eclipse / </i>Nullification of supernatural powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While Haesu believes she lacks a strong sense of justice, those around her see her differently. Her unwavering urge to help others has earned her the reputation of being a natural &quot;meddler.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While investigating the 'indiscriminate terror incident,' she gets closer to a shocking truth and finds herself at a crossroads\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/aaa11b247f9cafe03b95b8b76fdb02b6.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dallae</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cI\u2019d rather die than be on the losing end.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Member of <i>Eclipse / </i>Illusion manipulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haesu\u2019s partner, who uncovered the hidden truth behind the indiscriminate terror incident, holds Haesu in special regard due to their unique bond that has lasted since childhood. However, toward others, she remains indifferent and often acts with cruelty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/113c758db99c2dd51bba58a8abae3e33.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Prophet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The commander-in-chief of <i>Eclipse</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;My only choice is to sin to survive and lay bare my sins before our great Mother.&quot;\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only person capable of hearing the voice of <strong>La</strong>, the creator of all things, she is revered and venerated as the <strong>Spokesperson of the Sun God</strong> by all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/4b2db6c6828d1d488db65558da465284.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Villain A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMay god\u2019s blessings be with you.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The host of an elite-only party, Haesu and Dalle encounter during their undercover investigation. The mask, depicting a goat\u2014a symbol often associated with evil\u2014adds an eerie and unsettling aura to her presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/1955cb61931b8c7c6beaa9847cf3437c.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Villain B</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThere is no point in knowing, You\u2019re going to die anyway.\u201d\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An individual who moves according to A\u2019s orders, with her name, age, past, and everything else shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/d09ef14ca0d32fffe5cdc3374222a79b.avif?t=1755218009\" width=510 height=510 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Villain C</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cTo those of you living fleeting lives\u2026 I shall grant an eternity of hell.\u201d</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A figure harboring profound hostility toward <strong>Solarism and Eclipse</strong>. She leads those around her with her formidable supernatural power, and wherever she treads, only the pitch-black void of death remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>59 Steam Achievements Await.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/536c419844f70a646a5f3b8786d45799.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=471 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Eclipse</i> is more than just a visual novel\u2014it\u2019s a test of mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UTOPIA OF WOMEN\u2014the god, rulers, soldiers, even villains: all female.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo available in 4 languages! (\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4/English/\u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587/\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e)</strong>\u2739The full English release has been officially localized by a professional translator.\u2739</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/b8f3d332c9ac91d10e6e0a6350c6dc0d.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=941 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All men have been wiped from the Earth. </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It marks the dawn of a new world.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Only women remain in this post-apocalyptic world, where a vast and intriguing epic unfolds.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/64b485328ba1f52dc470be826473408c.poster.avif?t=1755218009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/64b485328ba1f52dc470be826473408c.webm?t=1755218009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Under the blessing of La, the one true god, men vanished from this world 1,500 years ago.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this flawless peace, 'Eclipse,' a special forces unit composed of those with supernatural powers, has upheld law and order in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280020/extras/6ac6690801b232d45f8